@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-46 - View Return Requests

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-46
FE -> API: GET /returns
API -> Service: Execute View Return Requests
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách return requests hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Danh sách return requests hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/returns
2. System gọi API GET /returns
3. System trả về: type, orderCode, productId, colorName, size, reason,\nstatus, createdAt
4. Admin có thể lọc theo status (PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, PROCESSING,\nCOMPLETED)
end note
@enduml
